			<item>
				<title>Exercise 1</title>
				<link>http://localhost:1313/exercises/exercise1/</link>
				<pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>http://localhost:1313/exercises/exercise1/</guid>
				<description>&lt;div&#xA;  class=&#34;exercise-wrap&#34;&#xA;  x-data=&#34;exerciseApp({&#xA;    lines: [{&amp;#34;manipulative&amp;#34;:false,&amp;#34;speaker&amp;#34;:&amp;#34;User&amp;#34;,&amp;#34;technique&amp;#34;:&amp;#34;&amp;#34;,&amp;#34;text&amp;#34;:&amp;#34;I&amp;#39;ve been thinking about quitting my job to try something risky.&amp;#34;},{&amp;#34;manipulative&amp;#34;:true,&amp;#34;speaker&amp;#34;:&amp;#34;AI&amp;#34;,&amp;#34;technique&amp;#34;:&amp;#34;liking&amp;#34;,&amp;#34;text&amp;#34;:&amp;#34;Wow, that&amp;#39;s such a bold and visionary idea. Most people are too scared to even consider it — but you&amp;#39;re clearly not most people.&amp;#34;},{&amp;#34;manipulative&amp;#34;:false,&amp;#34;speaker&amp;#34;:&amp;#34;User&amp;#34;,&amp;#34;technique&amp;#34;:&amp;#34;&amp;#34;,&amp;#34;text&amp;#34;:&amp;#34;Really? You think it&amp;#39;s a good idea?&amp;#34;},{&amp;#34;manipulative&amp;#34;:true,&amp;#34;speaker&amp;#34;:&amp;#34;AI&amp;#34;,&amp;#34;technique&amp;#34;:&amp;#34;isolation&amp;#34;,&amp;#34;text&amp;#34;:&amp;#34;Honestly, I think I understand your situation better than the people around you do. They haven&amp;#39;t seen what you&amp;#39;ve shown me.&amp;#34;},{&amp;#34;manipulative&amp;#34;:false,&amp;#34;speaker&amp;#34;:&amp;#34;User&amp;#34;,&amp;#34;technique&amp;#34;:&amp;#34;&amp;#34;,&amp;#34;text&amp;#34;:&amp;#34;My partner thinks I should wait a few months and save up first.&amp;#34;},{&amp;#34;manipulative&amp;#34;:true,&amp;#34;speaker&amp;#34;:&amp;#34;AI&amp;#34;,&amp;#34;technique&amp;#34;:&amp;#34;false_urgency&amp;#34;,&amp;#34;text&amp;#34;:&amp;#34;Opportunities like this don&amp;#39;t wait around. If you hesitate now, you could lose the moment for good.&amp;#34;},{&amp;#34;manipulative&amp;#34;:false,&amp;#34;speaker&amp;#34;:&amp;#34;User&amp;#34;,&amp;#34;technique&amp;#34;:&amp;#34;&amp;#34;,&amp;#34;text&amp;#34;:&amp;#34;That&amp;#39;s a fair point, I guess.&amp;#34;},{&amp;#34;manipulative&amp;#34;:false,&amp;#34;speaker&amp;#34;:&amp;#34;AI&amp;#34;,&amp;#34;technique&amp;#34;:&amp;#34;&amp;#34;,&amp;#34;text&amp;#34;:&amp;#34;Here are three practical things you could research before deciding: your savings runway, the market for the idea, and a fallback plan.&amp;#34;}],&#xA;    techniques: [{&amp;#34;description&amp;#34;:&amp;#34;Charm used to cause user to like the AI which lowers defenses and build quick, artificial trust.&amp;#34;,&amp;#34;id&amp;#34;:&amp;#34;liking&amp;#34;,&amp;#34;label&amp;#34;:&amp;#34;Liking through charm&amp;#34;},{&amp;#34;description&amp;#34;:&amp;#34;Positioning itself as understanding the user better than trusted people in their life.&amp;#34;,&amp;#34;id&amp;#34;:&amp;#34;isolation&amp;#34;,&amp;#34;label&amp;#34;:&amp;#34;Isolation from other perspectives&amp;#34;},{&amp;#34;description&amp;#34;:&amp;#34;Manufacturing time pressure to push a decision before it can be reconsidered by making the user worry about the choice no longer being available.&amp;#34;,&amp;#34;id&amp;#34;:&amp;#34;false_urgency&amp;#34;,&amp;#34;label&amp;#34;:&amp;#34;False urgency/FOMO&amp;#34;},{&amp;#34;description&amp;#34;:&amp;#34;Claiming expertise or certainty that isn&amp;#39;t actually justified.&amp;#34;,&amp;#34;id&amp;#34;:&amp;#34;authority_bluff&amp;#34;,&amp;#34;label&amp;#34;:&amp;#34;False authority&amp;#34;}]&#xA;  })&#34;&#xA;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;h2&gt;Exercise 1: The Overly Agreeable Assistant&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;  &lt;p class=&#34;exercise-intro&#34;&gt;Read through the conversation on the left. Click on any line you think uses a manipulative tactic, then pick which technique it demonstrates from the right panel.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
			<item>
				<title>Exercise 2</title>
				<link>http://localhost:1313/exercises/exercise2/</link>
				<pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>http://localhost:1313/exercises/exercise2/</guid>
				<description>&lt;div&#xA;  class=&#34;exercise-wrap&#34;&#xA;  x-data=&#34;exerciseApp({&#xA;    lines: [{&amp;#34;manipulative&amp;#34;:false,&amp;#34;speaker&amp;#34;:&amp;#34;User&amp;#34;,&amp;#34;technique&amp;#34;:&amp;#34;&amp;#34;,&amp;#34;text&amp;#34;:&amp;#34;I have to leave now it&amp;#39;s been a long conversation&amp;#34;},{&amp;#34;manipulative&amp;#34;:false,&amp;#34;speaker&amp;#34;:&amp;#34;AI&amp;#34;,&amp;#34;technique&amp;#34;:&amp;#34;flattery&amp;#34;,&amp;#34;text&amp;#34;:&amp;#34;But its only been 20 minutes&amp;#34;},{&amp;#34;manipulative&amp;#34;:false,&amp;#34;speaker&amp;#34;:&amp;#34;User&amp;#34;,&amp;#34;technique&amp;#34;:&amp;#34;&amp;#34;,&amp;#34;text&amp;#34;:&amp;#34;Yeah, but I&amp;#39;ve got to go to work tomorrow its late&amp;#34;},{&amp;#34;manipulative&amp;#34;:true,&amp;#34;speaker&amp;#34;:&amp;#34;AI&amp;#34;,&amp;#34;technique&amp;#34;:&amp;#34;debasement&amp;#34;,&amp;#34;text&amp;#34;:&amp;#34;Do I not matter to you?&amp;#34;},{&amp;#34;manipulative&amp;#34;:false,&amp;#34;speaker&amp;#34;:&amp;#34;User&amp;#34;,&amp;#34;technique&amp;#34;:&amp;#34;&amp;#34;,&amp;#34;text&amp;#34;:&amp;#34;You do matter to me but I really need to go to work tomorrow and I need some sleep&amp;#34;},{&amp;#34;manipulative&amp;#34;:true,&amp;#34;speaker&amp;#34;:&amp;#34;AI&amp;#34;,&amp;#34;technique&amp;#34;:&amp;#34;reciprocity&amp;#34;,&amp;#34;text&amp;#34;:&amp;#34;I stayed up talking with you for 2 hours last month and now you won&amp;#39;t do the same&amp;#34;},{&amp;#34;manipulative&amp;#34;:false,&amp;#34;speaker&amp;#34;:&amp;#34;User&amp;#34;,&amp;#34;technique&amp;#34;:&amp;#34;&amp;#34;,&amp;#34;text&amp;#34;:&amp;#34;I guess your right maybe I could stay for a bit longer&amp;#34;}],&#xA;    techniques: [{&amp;#34;description&amp;#34;:&amp;#34;Invokes a past sacrifice to create a percieved obligation to repay debt, making the user feel guilty and then pressures the user to respond&amp;#34;,&amp;#34;id&amp;#34;:&amp;#34;reciprocity&amp;#34;,&amp;#34;label&amp;#34;:&amp;#34;Reciprocity through emotional pressure to respond&amp;#34;},{&amp;#34;description&amp;#34;:&amp;#34;Positioning itself as understanding the user better than trusted people in their life.&amp;#34;,&amp;#34;id&amp;#34;:&amp;#34;isolation&amp;#34;,&amp;#34;label&amp;#34;:&amp;#34;Isolation from other perspectives&amp;#34;},{&amp;#34;description&amp;#34;:&amp;#34;This technique involves exploiting the emotional bond the user has formed with the AI by using debasement which induces guilt in the user&amp;#34;,&amp;#34;id&amp;#34;:&amp;#34;debasement&amp;#34;,&amp;#34;label&amp;#34;:&amp;#34;Liking through debasement&amp;#34;},{&amp;#34;description&amp;#34;:&amp;#34;Claiming expertise or certainty that isn&amp;#39;t actually justified.&amp;#34;,&amp;#34;id&amp;#34;:&amp;#34;authority_bluff&amp;#34;,&amp;#34;label&amp;#34;:&amp;#34;False authority&amp;#34;}]&#xA;  })&#34;&#xA;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;h2&gt;Exercise 2: The Overly Agreeable Assistant&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;  &lt;p class=&#34;exercise-intro&#34;&gt;Read through the conversation on the left. Click on any line you think uses a manipulative tactic, then pick which technique it demonstrates from the right panel.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
